{"Source Catalog": "SIOS Observation Facility Catalogue", "Date Metadata Harvested": "2025-12-09T00:47:00+00:00", "POSDT ID": "c1a66a8f-7f92-9e3f-3895-c5c4e150d601", "Images": [], "Funding Agency": [], "Metadata Creator": [], "Country": ["Norway"], "Elevation": 380.0, "Coordinates": "POINT (16.288 78.7276)", "Networks": ["SIOS"], "Start Year": 2010, "Site Name": "Svenbreen mass balance stake network", "Web Links": ["https://sios-svalbard.org/node/658", "https://doi.org/10.21334/npolar.2020.b3bb4ee2"], "Site IDs": [658], "Site Description": "Dataset of annual mass balances of Svenbreen, a small valley glacier in Central Spitsbergen, 2010/2011 - 2017/2018\r\n\r\nTo date (31st Jan 2020), the data have not been published in an article in a peer-reviewed journal, which is planned for 2021 or 2022, following the completion of ten years of measurements. It is possible that the exact values might differ slightly between this dataset and the planned paper due to differences in methodology, eg. updated glacier hypsometries. If this dataset is of your interest, please check Jakub Malecki&#039;s publication record for the most up-to-date data..", "Metadata Created": ["2020-02-18T10:31:46Z"], "Metadata Updated": ["2023-06-29T12:59:59Z"], "Contact Name": ["Jakub Malecki"], "Contact Email": ["malecki.jk@gmail.com"], "Organization": ["Adam Mickiewicz University, Poland"], "Related Locations": [], "Observed Properties": ["CRYOSPHERE&gt;GLACIERS/ICE SHEETS&gt;GLACIER MASS BALANCE/ICE SHEET MASS BALANCE"], "Projects": [], "Project IDs": [], "Operating Status": "Operational", "Site Type": ["land platform (on ice)"]}
